        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, district heat, large area network, for warm water</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, district heat, large area network, for warm water
The lifetime of the network is assumed to be 30 years. Typical heat loss is between 5 and 10% (not including heat exchanger at the consumer side).;
UUID: 8a0204cf-b7ec-38ce-9a9c-444a7f60b1ec
The construction and operation of the district heating network. It is based on pipes of different diameters with concrete jacket pipes. The production of the heat is not part of this system.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8a0204cf-b7ec-38ce-9a9c-444a7f60b1ec.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
